                                "sense_id": "c2638be4-8ff0-3045-85dc-78d95bad54ac",
                                "text": "If he were not over conſciencious in that, vnder colour of ſome treatie, parlie or accord, to take any advantage of his enemies: he was as little ſcrupulous, in that he required no other vertue in his Souldiers, but valour; […]"
