                                "sense_id": "c2638be4-8ff0-3045-85dc-78d95bad54ac",
                                "text": "Are you an obsessive lover of routine, overconscientious, and think cleanliness is next to godliness? Beware. You may be nearly twice as likely to die from a heart attack as more laid back friends and colleagues."
                            }
